# runtime output
logs/

# python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# build/handoff artifacts -- docker save output is ~121 MB, do not commit it,
# and the encrypted handoff zips are derived files (one of them is the same
# 121 MB again). Nothing here belongs in history.
*.tar.gz
*.tar
*.zip
*.7z

# local-only environment helper (paths are machine specific)
env-uhd-py311.sh

# LaTeX intermediates. theory.pdf and zenoh-protocol.pdf ARE tracked
# deliberately -- most readers will not have a TeX install -- so rebuild and
# commit the PDF whenever its .tex changes, or the two drift apart silently.
# Build with: pdflatex <name>.tex (twice, for cross-references)
*.aux
*.toc
*.out
*.synctex.gz
theory.log
zenoh-protocol.log

# console/cache/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The baked OpenStreetMap
# footprints are committed so the 3D layer works offline and out of the box
# rather than depending on a free API that refuses whole cities under load.
# They stay under ODbL, not this repository's AGPLv3 -- see
# console/cache/README.md, which is the attribution the licence requires.
